          <!-- 1. Terms & Conditions -->
          <article class="policy-article-card" id="terms-and-conditions">
            <span class="section-tag">RBI NBFC Compliance</span>
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.85rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 8px 0 16px;">1. Terms & Conditions
            </h2>
            <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.8125rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">Last Updated: January 2026</p>
            <div class="policy-doc">
              <h4>Acceptance of Digital Loan Terms</h4>
              <p>These Terms and Conditions govern the access and use of the digital lending platform, website, and
                credit services operated by <strong>Lord Krishna Financial Services Ltd</strong> under the brand name
                <strong>"Prest Loans"</strong>. By submitting a loan request, uploading KYC documents, or authorizing an
                e-NACH mandate, the borrower agrees to these terms.
              </p>
              <h4>Borrower Eligibility & Sanction</h4>
              <p>Loans are sanctioned based on automated and manual underwriting criteria, bank cash flow scrutiny,
                CIBIL bureau rating, and verified turnover proofs. Sanction and disbursement remain at the sole
                discretion of the NBFC.</p>
              <h4>Electronic Repayment Mandate</h4>
              <p>Borrowers agree to maintain sufficient balance in the designated bank account on installment due dates.
                Any bounce caused by insufficient funds will incur standard bounce charges as disclosed in the Schedule
                of Charges.</p>

              <div
                style="margin-top: 24px; padding: 20px; background: #fdf6fa; border: 1px solid #ebd3e7; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;">
                <div>
                  <h5 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 4px;">Explore Full Terms
